  ("Will a heat pump keep my Ottawa home warm at -30°C?", "A cold-climate heat pump like the Midea EVOX G3 is rated to heat down to -30°C, so it can carry most Ottawa homes through a normal winter. For the coldest nights we pair it with backup heat, either your gas furnace or an electric air handler, sized from a heat-loss calculation."),
